# Ireland Total Overhaul — Concealed Evidence Ledger.
# GUI-only surface contract. The sealed state is intentionally generic until the
# player inspects the evidence; the scripted-GUI registration hides evidence rows before reveal.
# Reveal contract: the authored Hidden Evidence Council completion sets
# slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_revealed after independent restoration review.
# The inspect button only requests a row review and cannot reveal the ledger by itself.
# Live ledger projections use the stable contract names
# slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_credible_count,
# slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_category_count,
# slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_region_count,
# slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_public_knowledge,
# slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_disqualifier_count and
# slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_obligation_count, plus the cultural record
# variables slopx_ireland_cultural_archival_record,
# slopx_ireland_cultural_site_stewardship,
# slopx_ireland_cultural_regional_participation and
# slopx_ireland_cultural_language_service.
# Registration handoff: window_name = slopx_ireland_concealed_evidence_ledger_window
# context_type = decision_category; no parent-window token is used.
# dirty = slopx_ireland_evidence_gui_dirty
# click hooks = *_provenance_row, *_sites_row, *_public_knowledge_row,
# *_disqualifiers_row, *_obligations_row, *_inspect_button, *_close_button.

